      reach: { ...axes.human.reach, basis: `${attribution.residentsInJointDeclineBasinsBillions} billion people live in joint-decline basins, but residence is exposure rather than demonstrated harm. Central level 1 records multi-local exposure to a plausible current consequence pathway; zero to broad harmed-population reach remains open and the resident total is not mapped to a level.` },
      persistence: { ...axes.human.persistence, basis: 'Recharge and storage stress can outlast an individual dry season, but the study does not report the duration of household or service consequences. Central level 2 is a structured multi-season boundary, with event-scale to multi-year outcomes retained; the 20-year model record is excluded.' },
