      reach: { ...axes.ecosystem.reach, basis: `${recharge.riverBasinsWithDecliningRechargePercent}% of river basins show recharge decline. Basin count is geographic context, not the affected share of groundwater-dependent ecosystem distribution. Central level 2 records widespread multi-basin pressure while levels 1–3 remain until a compatible ecosystem denominator exists.` },
