      counterfactual: `Compare terminal consequences under ${label} with otherwise comparable maritime activity without the attributable pressure, retaining fuel, routing, capacity, insurance, contracts, weather and adaptation as modifiers.`,
      aggregationDenominator: isLane || isHeat ? 'Unique people with attributable material or service consequences.' : 'The compatible ecosystem distribution with measured shipping-attributable condition loss.',
