      normalization: isSteel ? 'Use conventional route share and direct industry emissions as production-pressure context. Do not treat cost premium, global production scope or years since an intensity uptick as human or ecosystem harm.' : 'Use the current transition gap as pressure. Do not count planned capacity, scenario milestones, addressable industry share or global extent as realized harm.',
