      attribution: 'Demand reflected households, businesses, restrictions, pricing, leakage, weather and supply conditions. The record does not isolate terminal harm caused by the remaining 50-million-litre daily exceedance.',
      limitations: 'One city and one historical drought response cannot establish global reach. The source does not quantify injury, illness, permanent service loss or recovery attributable to the demand peak itself.',
