      fullRecordTrend: 'The evidence establishes widespread current fragmentation and adverse freshwater-biota responses, but it does not supply a complete yearly global trend or show that every river segment is worsening.',
      observedImpact: 'Direct ecosystem consequences include lost geographic-range connectivity, reduced abundance and reduced genetic diversity. Fisheries dependence, nearby economic outcomes and freshwater ecosystem-collapse nodes remain separate.',
