      overlapExclusions: ['Do not add Dam and Diversion Infrastructure, Freshwater Ecosystem Collapse, Fish Landing Supply Disruption or Fishery Protein Dependence scores.', 'Do not count 158 million inland-fisheries beneficiaries or people living near dams as harmed.', 'Do not reuse the 63% long-river share as severity or record length as persistence.'],
      limitations: 'The global reach measure is long-river specific, biological evidence is fish-heavy, and the admitted evidence is not a complete all-barrier, all-taxa causal inventory.',
