      isLatestAvailable: true, recencyCheckedOn: '2026-09-23',
      recencyRationale: 'The 2021 global flood database is the newest compatible event-level global source located with deaths, displacement, mapped inundation and reported causes. A 2025 global model supplies current exposure context and the SSP2-4.5 outlook but does not replace the observed consequence record.',
