      reach: { lower: 1, central: 1, upper: 2, basis: 'Direct ecological measurements cover two neighbouring southwest Greenland fjords. Ice-sheet area, satellite coverage and millimetres of global mean sea-level rise do not measure the affected share of polar or coastal ecosystem distribution, so central reach remains localized.' },
